# Git push target

This workspace is the **Claurix integrated** snapshot. When the user asks to push to GitHub (or "push changes"), use **`claurix_integrated`**, not `origin`.

| Remote | Repo | When to use |
|--------|------|-------------|
| **`claurix_integrated`** | `Siddharth-chauhan17/claurix_integrated` | **Default** — all normal pushes |
| `origin` | `Siddharth-chauhan17/insurify` | Only if the user explicitly asks for insurify |

## Commands

- After commit: `git push claurix_integrated main` (or `git push` — `main` tracks `claurix_integrated/main`)
- Push insurify only when requested: `git push origin main`

Branch `main` upstream is `claurix_integrated/main`.
